{"id":"NCT05485961","title":"Combined Dose-Finding and CV Outcomes Study With CSL300 (Clazakizumab) in Adult Subjects With ESKD Undergoing Dialysis (POSIBIL6ESKD)","official":"A Phase 2b / 3, Multicenter, Randomized, Double-Blind, Placebo-Controlled, Combined Dose-Finding and Cardiovascular Outcome Study to Investigate the Efficacy and Safety of CSL300 (Clazakizumab) in Subjects With End Stage Kidney Disease Undergoing Dialysis","summary":"This is a two-part, phase 2b and phase 3 combined prospective, interventional, multicenter, randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled study.\n\nPart 1: Phase 2b is a dose-finding study for CSL300 vs placebo. Part 2: Phase 3 aims to assess the efficacy of CSL300 vs placebo on cardiovascular (CV) outcomes and safety in subjects with systemic inflammation and either atherosclerotic cardiovascular disease (ASCVD) or diabetes with end stage kidney disease (ESKD) undergoing maintenance dialysis.","conditions":["End Stage Kidney Disease"],"interventions":[{"type":"DRUG","name":"CSL300"},{"type":"DRUG","name":"Placebo"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Male or female at least 18 years of age.\n* A diagnosis of ESKD undergoing maintenance dialysis for at least 12 weeks.\n* Serum hs-CRP ≥ 2.0 mg/L.\n* A diagnosis of diabetes mellitus OR ASCVD.\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* Subjects who participated in Part 1 (phase 2b) are not eligible to participate in Part 2 (phase 3).\n* Concomitant use of systemic immunosuppressant drugs.\n* Part 1 (Phase 2b) excludes subjects with a positive TB or a history of latent TB, whereas Part 2 (Phase 3) excludes active TB but allows inclusion of subjects with a latent TB and at least 4 weeks of prophylactic TB treatment.\n* Abnormal LFTs.\n* Any life-threatening disease expected to result in death within 12 months.\n* A history of GI perforation, inflammatory bowel disease (except fully excised. ulcerative colitis), or peptic ulcer disease.\n* Clinically significant active infection or history of opportunistic or invasive fungal infection.","minAge":"18 Years","maxAge":"","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"INTERVENTIONAL","purpose":"SUPPORTIVE_CARE","enrollment":3110,"start":"2024-04-27","pcd":"2029-05-22","upd":"2026-09-21","sponsor":"CSL Behring","areas":["other"],"central":["Trial Registration Coordinator · +1 610-878-4697 · clinicaltrials@cslbehring.com"],"sites":[{"f":"Nephrology of North Alabama","city":"Decatur","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35601","s":"R","lat":34.6059,"lon":-86.9833,"c":""},{"f":"Nephrology Consultants, LLC","city":"Huntsville","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35805","s":"R","lat":34.7304,"lon":-86.5859,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"DaVita Clinical Research Montgomery","city":"Montgomery","pr":"Alabama","zip":"36117","s":"R","lat":32.3668,"lon":-86.3,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"AKDHC Medical","city":"Glendale","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85305","s":"R","lat":33.5386,"lon":-112.186,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"Kidney Disease Medical Group","city":"Glendale","pr":"Arizona","zip":"91206","s":"R","lat":33.5386,"lon":-112.186,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"AKDHC Medical","city":"Phoenix","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85018","s":"R","lat":33.4484,"lon":-112.074,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"AKDHC Medical","city":"Tucson","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85705","s":"R","lat":32.2217,"lon":-110.9265,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"Southern Arizona VA Health Care System","city":"Tucson","pr":"Arizona","zip":"85723","s":"R","lat":32.2217,"lon":-110.9265,"c":"Trial Information Contact"},{"f":"National Institute of Clinical Research","city":"Bakersfield","pr":"California","zip":"93309","s":"R","lat":35.3733,"lon":-119.0187,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"Amicis Research Center","city":"Beverly Hills","pr":"California","zip":"90211","s":"STOP","lat":34.0736,"lon":-118.4004,"c":""},{"f":"California Institute of Renal Research","city":"Chula Vista","pr":"California","zip":"91910","s":"R","lat":32.6401,"lon":-117.0842,"c":"Use Central Contact"},{"f":"The Medical Research Gr